WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:00.923
- We are back

00:00:00.923 --> 00:00:02.880
and there are many
sub-genres in country music,

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.390
alternative, bluegrass,
honky-tonk, just to name a few.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.920
Our next guest is an up-and-comer

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.570
who's passionate about bringing western

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:10.740
back to country music.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.530
He has a new album now and
it's called "White Buffalo."

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.660
Now performing "Long Live Cowgirls,"

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.100
put your hands together
for Ian Munsick, everybody.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.859
(audience applauding)
(audience cheering)

